The MIT license covers first-party source code, documentation, and the generated
synthetic R6 checkpoint files in this release. Dependencies are not bundled and
retain their own licenses. NumPy and SciPy are external dependencies.

No third-party industrial datasets, simulator distributions, paper PDFs, or
personal coordination logs are included in this release package.

The historical DiagnosticTS directory in the GitHub repository is retained for
historical source reference. It is not required by the R6 package, and old CMI
or causal-attribution interpretations are not validated by this release.
